Image Captioning
Original notebook author: Arian Abdollahi
Source: https://www.kaggle.com/code/arianabdollahi/image-captioning

This repository contains an unmodified copy of the original notebook source
and an adapted Python package. The adaptation separates notebook code into
modules, changes preprocessing and metric handling, and adds command-line
workflows, configuration, tests, and documentation.

The source notebook is displayed under Apache License 2.0 on Kaggle.
One saved notebook result figure is reproduced for illustration; see
figures/README.md. Full training datasets, annotation files, and pretrained
weights are not distributed with this code. Dataset terms remain separate.
